{"body":{"text":["Every statement has a **status**, where it stands now: open, asked and not decided; proposed, the session's and not taken up by the author; leaning, inclined to with doubt; settled, decided; closed, no longer holding. These are Knowledge's own marks, with closed beside them. Each status points at what gave it, the utterance of the decision, and so whose it was (23/129). A statement's history is its versions (23/132)."]},"id":"1M89J41T0PT5000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Closed points at what closed it, a statement, a commit, a brief or the author's word, and may be opened again: \"Knowledge is built on its grounds, and any new ground may always exist, shifting the landscape of other pieces of knowledge\" (23/138). Of the two words offered, \"Closed is probably better. It's more precise\" than set aside, which \"can mean that it's a little bit softer than it is\" and \"tells more about the reason and might be wrong in that\", though closed \"is still ambiguous as to its reason\" (23/138); the reader offered both (23/137)."]},"id":"1M89J41T0PT5001","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["A **topic** is a short name, holding statements: \"topics need short names because topics naturally are addressable\" (23/116). A statement may stand in several topics, the session's answer (23/111); topics may hold topics, as he once thought, \"you can structure a group and there's a hierarchy in and of itself\" (23/86), and let compose: \"Yeah, why not?\" (23/112). A topic keeps its spans, the stretches of sessions where it was spoken of, each written between(session, from, to) (23/79, 23/80). Its spans are read from its statements' grounds, written by hand only where talk ran with nothing stated (23/129). A topic with nothing in Knowledge yet is, as the session put it, a debt in plain sight (23/91). Whether a topic is a brief is open (23/104 to 23/108)."]},"id":"1M89J41T0PT5002","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Work that belongs together is gathered in a brief in Knowledge, and its order is the prose of the way from here: \"We don't need to have structured and typed data for project management\" (23/100); the groups \"can be made by briefs\" (23/116). How a brief's flow holds statements, beside paragraphs, lists, code and briefs, is a question this keeping raised. *Open, the session's.*"]},"id":"1M89J41T0PT5003","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Threads, paths and cycles go once the sessions are drawn anew: \"Yes, threads and paths are let go, but so is more things, cycles, etc.\" (23/110). Condensations and measures go with them on the session's list, which he did not contest (23/111), though he once thought measures might be a dimension of their own (23/52). Statistics and their board stay, an idea the interface was not ready for (23/52). Glass's values, sovereignty and one source of truth among them, \"ought to be a brief somewhere anyway, probably\" (23/62), and wait for that brief. Until the redraw, the threads stand as they are."]},"id":"1M89J41T0PT5004","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Knowledge is to hold this practice whole, as a skill, so the next session can do it from Knowledge alone: \"the knowledge holon should contain naturally everything because it's a skill\" (23/130, 23/131). Its steps stand in the way from here."]},"id":"1M89J41T0PT5005","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Glass stays one store, its things namespaced within it as wholes, so each may later be loaded and depended on alone: \"It actually has its own structure, so maybe that's fine because we're namespacing inside the store anyway\" (18/105). The store holding Knowledge is wiki: \"Maybe we want to call it wiki\" (18/105). Measures and statistics stand with what they relate to: \"they should probably be stored with where they are\" (18/105); the cut put the measures with the author, since every one points at a session; measures are to go with the elevation, on the session's list, which he did not contest (23/111). *Leaning, 18/105.* The components were the first so taken away, at the author's word that they are not glass's: \"Definitely not, again the values of something being whole in and of itself\" (22/37, 22/43), the leaning so narrowed."]},"id":"1M89J41T0PT5006","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The author's words are quoted as he wrote or spoke them, cited by session and utterance, so 15/15 is the fifteenth session's fifteenth. A claim that is not plain fact closes with a mark: **Settled**, by the author, on the day or at the utterance given; **Leaning**, his, with his doubt quoted; **Proposed**, a session's, unratified and free to change; **Open**, a question standing. The elevation's statuses, under How we work, are these marks, with closed beside them."]},"id":"1M89J41T0PT5007","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Prose is holons too. A brief has a flow and sections: its flow holds paragraphs, lists, code or another brief, in any order (how it is to hold the elevation's statements is open, under Elevation), and its sections are briefs of its own, read after the flow, each under its name as a heading. A brief placed in another's flow is a face: a reading of its own that one may step into."]},"id":"1M89J41T0PT5008","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}